{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo version of <strong>BPROOF</strong> offers a focused look at the core gameplay experience.<br>In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>Singleplayer mode</strong> only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>two types of supernatural enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>one specific weapon type</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <strong>three full rounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>selected maps</strong> from the full version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This limited demo is designed to showcase the game\u2019s <strong>atmosphere, tension, and survival mechanics</strong> while providing a short but complete experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version of <strong>BPROOF</strong> includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Multiplayer Co-op</strong> (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All weapon types and equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More enemy variations and challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All maps and environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited gameplay sessions</strong> and continuous progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a taste of the horror and survival that awaits \u2014 and unlock the full experience in <strong>BPROOF</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4163410?t=1763224317","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163410/d16c9c207e873293d1cb73e685f1eebe48c7419c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763224317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s